#: src/ch06-00-enums.md:1
msgid "Enums and Pattern Matching"
msgstr "枚举与模式匹配"

#: src/ch06-00-enums.md:3
msgid ""
"In this chapter, we’ll look at enumerations, also referred to as _enums_. "
"Enums allow you to define a type by enumerating its possible variants. First "
"we’ll define and use an enum to show how an enum can encode meaning along "
"with data. Next, we’ll explore a particularly useful enum, called `Option`, "
"which expresses that a value can be either something or nothing. Then, we’ll "
"look at how pattern matching in the `match` expression makes it easy to run "
"different code for different values of an enum. Finally, we’ll cover how the "
"`if let` construct is another convenient and concise idiom available to "
"handle enums in your code."
msgstr ""
"在本章中，我们将探讨枚举类型，也称为“enums”。枚举类型允许我们通过列举其可能的"
"取值来定义一种类型。首先，我们将定义一个并使用枚举，以展示枚举如何同时编码含"
"义和数据。接下来，我们将探讨一个特别有用的枚举类型，称为`Option`，它表示一个"
"值可以是某种状态或者不存在。然后，我们将了解`match`表达式中的模式匹配如何使得"
"执行不同的操作变得简单。不同枚举值的代码。最后，我们将介绍`if let`构造方法，"
"这是一种方便且简洁的语法，可用于在代码中处理枚举类型。"
